    <h1 class="text-display" style="margin-top: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Full Catalog Sandbox</h1>
    <p class="text-body-secondary" style="font-size: 1.15rem; max-width: 820px; line-height: 1.55;">
      Master component verification surface testing all 185 elements from <code>UI Upgrade - Element_Catalog.csv</code>. 
      <br><strong>Viewing Mode: Single-Column Inspection Ledger</strong> (All elements rendered at 100% width to eliminate container clipping).
    </p>
    <div style="display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1.25rem; font-size: 0.8rem;" class="text-body-secondary">
      <div>Compiled: <strong style="color: var(--color-primary-default);">{% buildTime %}</strong></div>
      <div>Catalog Scope: <strong style="color: var(--color-primary-default);">185 Total Items</strong></div>
    </div>
  </header>

